C5: follow-money out 2 hops shows 82 tx to 10 accounts (5 A,5 B) then 123 tx to 17 accounts (8 A,9 B) totalling $43.48M; 8 transactions returned to subject forming a cycle. Evidence tool summary follow_money says hop1 82 tx, 10 accounts (5 A,5 B), about $2,189,125; hop2 123 tx, 17 accounts (8 A,9 B), about $43,480,951; money came back in 8 transactions (example). Also signal cycle shows 2-hop ring. Supported.

