C7: inference about network signals listing specific signals. Evidence analyze_network lists those signals with same details. Supported.

C8: watchlist screening matches subject name to SYN-00146 'Adams PLC' but only name match (DOB and country differ); 15 Institution B counterparties not screenable. Evidence tool summary screen_watchlist says exactly that. Supported.

X1: claim no burst of one-off transfers – subject’s counterparties recur (one_off_transfers context 0/3). Evidence analyze_network shows one_off_transfers [context, 0/3]: No burst of one-off bank transfers: the subject's transfer counterparties recur. Supported.

X2: claim no layered transfers detected – none of subject’s one-off transfers passed on within 72h (layered_transfers context 0/3). Evidence shows layered_transfers [context, 0/3]: None of the subject's one-off transfers is passed on (or was funded) by another transfer within 72 hours. Supported.

X3: claim no high-volume hubs among counterparties (hubs context 0/3). Evidence shows hubs [context, 0/3]: 0 of 12 counterparties are high-volume hubs (50+ counterparties each), carrying 0% of subject's value. Supported.

All claims supported. Provide verdicts accordingly.</think>{
